# The one SDL2.dll the GUI uses on Windows (docs/contracts/cli/gui.md sections 2 and 6): the official libsdl-org
# release, by exact URL, verified by SHA-256 before anything is extracted. Never fetch it unpinned, never cache it.
# The hash is the one GitHub shows for the release asset (API field digest) and equals the SHA-256 of a download
# over TLS from this URL. Changing the version means changing both lines in one reviewed PR.
